own owl feather at elbow, palette #231F2E #4A3042 #735044 #A57554 #E7AE73 #F5D69A. 5 bottom-middle: silver-grey Hippogriff feather over stone L, palette #231F2E #41465C #687486 #A6B1AE #D6D8BF. 6 bottom-right: moonlit vine with a pale Mooncalf crescent at elbow, palette #231F2E #24483F #3F6A45 #71934B #70A8B6 #B7DEE0. Increasing richness across the six, preserve equally coarse 16-pixel grid and empty L interiors.\nCandidate 1: use restrained geometric square clusters, strict regular block grid as highest priority.",
